   - Must have (e.g., stay in place X days, avoid eviction record, avoid admission)
   - Nice to have (e.g., cash payment schedule, moveout assistance, confidentiality)
   - Dealbreakers (e.g., any admission of wrongdoing, waiving custody/support claims)

