   - What will you do if no settlement is reached? Can you move quickly, is temporary housing available, can you pursue other relief?
   - Ask Robert to quantify likely trial outcomes (probability × outcomes) so you can compare to settlement offers.

3. Authority
   - Who will speak at the conference (you, your attorney)? Does your attorney need full settlement authority or do you want to sign off on offers?

4. Opening offer and concessions
   - Ask Robert for a recommended opening position and the minimum acceptable terms.

